msgid ""
"See how sales compare with last period, your busiest hours and days, best-"
"selling and unsold dishes, how customers pay and how fast the kitchen is."
msgstr ""
"Bandingkan penjualan dengan periode sebelumnya, lihat jam dan hari tersibuk, "
"hidangan terlaris dan tidak laku, cara pelanggan membayar, dan kecepatan "
"dapur."

msgid ""
"Enter the change in the drawer before selling, record cash in and out, and "
"reconcile at the end of the day: expected vs counted, over or short, with a "
"printable report."
msgstr ""
"Catat kembalian sebelum berjualan, kas masuk dan keluar, lalu cocokkan di "
"akhir hari: seharusnya vs dihitung, lebih atau kurang, dengan laporan cetak."

msgid ""
"Open more branches under the same login, copy your menu to them in one "
"click, and see revenue and profit for every branch and for the whole "
"business."
msgstr ""
"Buka lebih banyak cabang dengan login yang sama, salin menu ke cabang itu "
"dengan sekali klik, dan lihat pendapatan serta laba setiap cabang dan "
"seluruh usaha."

msgid "Connect your own website, mobile ordering app or delivery partners. Their orders arrive live in the right branch, are counted as revenue when completed, and you get API keys, webhooks, a request log and a test key."
msgstr "Hubungkan situs web, aplikasi pemesanan, atau mitra pengantaran Anda. Pesanan masuk langsung ke cabang yang tepat, dihitung pendapatan saat selesai, dan Anda mendapat kunci API, webhook, log permintaan, dan kunci uji."

msgid ""
"Write down what you spend each day and see your real profit for today, this "
"week, this month and this year."
msgstr ""
"Catat pengeluaran setiap hari dan lihat laba sebenarnya hari ini, minggu "
"ini, bulan ini, dan tahun ini."

msgid ""
"Create professional price offers for catering, events and procurement bids "
"from your menu, with amount in words, and print them as PDF in four "
"languages."
msgstr ""
"Buat penawaran harga profesional untuk katering, acara, dan tender dari menu "
"Anda, dengan terbilang, dan cetak sebagai PDF dalam empat bahasa."

msgid "Available in:"
msgstr "Tersedia di:"

