msgstr "Terakhir diperbarui: 9 Oktober 2026"

msgid "1. The service"
msgstr "1. Layanan"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"%(name)s provides QR code menus, table ordering and restaurant management "
"tools to food businesses (\"you\"). By registering, you accept these terms "
"on behalf of your business."
msgstr ""
"%(name)s menyediakan menu kode QR, pemesanan di meja, dan alat manajemen "
"restoran untuk usaha makanan (\"Anda\"). Dengan mendaftar, Anda menerima "
"ketentuan ini atas nama usaha Anda."

msgid "2. Your account"
msgstr "2. Akun Anda"

msgid ""
"You must give correct information about your business and keep your login "
"details secret. You are responsible for everything done with your account "
"and your staff accounts. We may ask you to verify your business (for example "
"with your business registration or tax number) before you can use some "
"features."
msgstr ""
"Anda wajib memberi informasi yang benar tentang usaha Anda dan menjaga "
"kerahasiaan data login. Anda bertanggung jawab atas semua yang dilakukan "
"dengan akun Anda dan akun staf Anda. Kami dapat meminta verifikasi usaha "
"(misalnya dengan registrasi usaha atau nomor pajak) sebelum Anda memakai "
"beberapa fitur."

msgid "3. Branches"
msgstr "3. Cabang"

msgid ""
"All branches in one account must be owned and operated by the same business, "
"under the same business registration and brand name."
msgstr ""
"Semua cabang dalam satu akun harus dimiliki dan dijalankan oleh usaha yang "
"sama, dengan registrasi usaha dan nama merek yang sama."

msgid ""
"Each new branch is reviewed by our team before it is activated. A branch "
"that belongs to a different business is not allowed: we may suspend it, or "
"move it to a separate account that is billed separately."
msgstr ""
"Setiap cabang baru ditinjau tim kami sebelum diaktifkan. Cabang milik usaha "
"lain tidak diizinkan: kami dapat menangguhkannya atau memindahkannya ke akun "
"terpisah yang ditagih terpisah."

msgid "4. Plans and payment"
msgstr "4. Paket dan pembayaran"

msgid ""
"Plans are billed monthly in US dollars. Each plan includes a fixed number of "
"branches; extra branches are a monthly add-on. If an invoice is not paid "
"after the grace period, ordering is switched off until it is paid. Prices "
"may change with 30 days' notice."
msgstr ""
"Paket ditagih bulanan dalam dolar AS. Setiap paket mencakup sejumlah cabang "
"tetap; cabang tambahan adalah add-on bulanan. Jika faktur tidak dibayar "
"setelah masa tenggang, pemesanan dimatikan sampai dibayar. Harga dapat "
"berubah dengan pemberitahuan 30 hari."

msgid "5. Your data"
msgstr "5. Data Anda"

msgid ""
"Your menus, orders and revenue records belong to you. We use them only to "
"provide the service and keep each branch's data separate. We don't sell your "
"data."
msgstr ""
"Menu, pesanan, dan catatan pendapatan Anda adalah milik Anda. Kami "
"memakainya hanya untuk menyediakan layanan dan memisahkan data setiap "
"cabang. Kami tidak menjual data Anda."

msgid "6. Acceptable use"
msgstr "6. Penggunaan yang wajar"

msgid ""
"Don't use the service for anything illegal, to mislead customers, or to "
"disrupt the platform. We may suspend accounts that break these terms."
msgstr ""
"Jangan memakai layanan untuk hal ilegal, menyesatkan pelanggan, atau "
"mengganggu platform. Kami dapat menangguhkan akun yang melanggar ketentuan "
"ini."

msgid "7. Liability"
msgstr "7. Tanggung jawab"

msgid ""
"We work hard to keep the service available, but we can't guarantee it will "
"always be uninterrupted. To the extent the law allows, we are not liable for "
"indirect losses such as lost sales."
msgstr ""
"Kami berusaha menjaga layanan tetap tersedia, tetapi tidak dapat menjamin "
"selalu tanpa gangguan. Sejauh diizinkan hukum, kami tidak bertanggung jawab "
"atas kerugian tidak langsung seperti kehilangan penjualan."

msgid "8. Contact"
msgstr "8. Kontak"

msgid "Questions about these terms:"
msgstr "Pertanyaan tentang ketentuan ini:"

